{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20496","headline":"新城甲仗楼 · 张籍","name":"新城甲仗楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢氏起新楼，西临城角头。\n图功百尺丽，藏器五兵修。\n结缔榱甍固，虚明户槛幽。\n鱼龙卷旗帜，霜雪积戈矛。\n暑雨熇烝隔，凉风宴位留。\n地高形出没，山静气清优。\n睥睨斜光彻，阑干宿霭浮。\n芊芊秔稻色，脉脉苑谿流。\n郡化黄丞相，诗成沈隐侯。\n居兹良得景，殊胜岘山游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20496.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20496","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}